#: ../../troubleshooting/scopes_directx.rst:11
msgid "Windows issue with scopes"
msgstr "Problema de Windows cos ámbitos"

#: ../../troubleshooting/scopes_directx.rst:16
msgid "All video scopes are working with DirectX."
msgstr "Os ámbitos de vídeo funcionan con DirectX."

#: ../../troubleshooting/scopes_directx.rst:20
msgid "Workaround: Change the backend to OpenGL (:menuselection:`Settings --> OpenGL Backend --> OpenGL`)"
msgstr ""
"Apaño: cambia o motor a OpenGL (:menuselection:`Configuración --> Motor de "
"OpenGL --> OpenGL`)."

#: ../../troubleshooting/scopes_directx.rst:22
msgid "If it's still not working go to: :menuselection:`Help --> Reset Configuration` and try again."
msgstr ""
"Se segue sen funcionar, vai a :menuselection:`Axuda --> Restabelecer a "
"configuración` e inténtao de novo."
